> [The] Minister[ of][ Power][,] Works and[ Housing][,][ Bab][at][und]e F[ash][ola], has charged newly induct[ed] land[ survey]ors by[ the] Survey[ors][ Council] of[ Nigeria][ to][ exhibit] a[ high][ sense][ of][ professionalism] in the[ discharge] of their[ duties].
